    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i'm not asking for a prescription or anything. i just have a bottle of advil right here and i know the standard dose for adults is usually 400mg or 600mg for bad pain. is it generally considered safe to just take 600mg at once if i need it to work quickly? i'm imminently needing to focus on work so i just need to know if that amount is typically okay.",
